    "name": "Disney Characters Index API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Community-maintained RESTful and GraphQL API exposing a database of 9,820+ Disney characters and the films, short films, TV shows, video games, and park attractions they appear in. The API is unauthenticated and read-only — every endpoint is a GET. The project is open source (BSD-3-Clause) at https://github.com/ManuCastrillonM/disney-api and is hosted at https://api.disneyapi.dev. Documentation is published at https://disneyapi.dev and a status page is available at https://status.disneyapi.dev. Disney and Disney characters are trademarks of The Walt Disney Company; this project is community fan-content and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Disney.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Disney API (community project)",
